{"url": "https://basgenbio.com/en/sub/career/culture.php", "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "language_hint": "en", "text": "바스젠바이오 BASGENBIO\n바스젠바이오는 K-Biobank를 기반으로 다양한 글로벌 바이오뱅크 데이터를 지속적으로 추가하여 자체 솔루션과 기술을 개발하고 검증합니다\n바스젠바이오는 K-Biobank를 기반으로 다양한 글로벌 바이오뱅크 데이터를 지속적으로 추가하여 자체 솔루션과 기술을 개발하고 검증합니다\n바스젠바이오 BASGENBIO EN KR Biobank Novel Biomarkers Target Discovery Drug Response Drug Repurposing Drug Combination Company Overview History Patents & certificates Location News Notice Press release Academic materials Newsletter Career Our Company Recruit Career Mission To extend the healthy lifespan of humanity. We seek Growth through Challenges Under the mission of \"extending the healthy lifespan of humanity,\" the life at Basgenbio translates to grasping new opportunities via continuous learning and advancement. Basgenbio supports those who advance towards new medical paradigm with innovative technological capabilities. Core Values Growth We create an environment where everyone can move forward. We constantly innovate and improve for a better future, never satisfied with the present. Globality We respect biodiversity for the sake of healthy life and strive to be one of the global corporate citizens. Challenge To pioneer the new medical market, we continuously challenge ourselves with new opportunities, never settling for the status quo. Collaboration We share our collaborative ability with partners, maximizing synergistic effects across all areas, from prevention to treatment. Responsibility Based on a sense of mission and responsibility as part of the global community, we will not cease conduct of research. Address. 101-1901, 109, Mapo-daero, Mapo-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea Tel. +82 2-6447-0200 Fax. 070-8740-8888 Mail. company@basgenbio.com ⓒ 2023. Basgenbio Inc. All rights reserved. PRIVACY POLICY LOCATION"}
